<title>UK: WestLB sets $200 million five-year bond, call.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets $200 million five-year bond, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTLB FINANCE CURACAO NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     7.25	MATURITY   *20.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.525   PAY DATE    20.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+38 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR AFTER TWO YEARS.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS</p>
<p> US/GB/NA/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
